{"title": "61K views \u00b7 1K reactions | Attend a fully funded symposium in Switzerland \ud83c\udde8\ud83c\udded The Global Leadership Challenge 2026, a joint initiative of the University of Oxford and St. Gallen Symposium, is now accepting applications. You can apply if you are: \u2705 A young professional aged 21\u201330, OR currently studying for a Master\u2019s or PhD \u2705 From any country and academic background \u2705 Passionate about leadership and creating positive change \u2705 Available to participate 10\u201314 December 2026 Selected participants will connect with 100 young leaders globally, receive leadership development and mentorship, and work on solutions to real-world global challenges. \ud83c\udfc6 The top 3 teams will be invited to Switzerland for the 2027 St. Gallen Symposium, with travel and accommodation covered. \ud83d\udcc5 Deadline: 5 November 2026 \ud83c\udf0d Applications are open now. \ud83d\udc49 Apply here: https://www.leadership-challenge.org/applynow Save this post and share it with someone who should apply! \u2764\ufe0f #talk2samafrica #Switzerland | Talk2sam", "description": "Attend a fully funded symposium in Switzerland \ud83c\udde8\ud83c\udded \n\nThe Global Leadership Challenge 2026, a joint initiative of the University of Oxford and St. Gallen Symposium, is now accepting applications.\n\nYou can apply if you are:\n\n\u2705 A young professional aged 21\u201330, OR currently studying for a Master\u2019s or PhD\n\u2705 From any country and academic background\n\u2705 Passionate about leadership and creating positive change\n\u2705 Available to participate 10\u201314 December 2026\n\nSelected participants will connect with 100 young leaders globally, receive leadership development and mentorship, and work on solutions to real-world global challenges.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 The top 3 teams will be invited to Switzerland for the 2027 St. Gallen Symposium, with travel and accommodation covered.\n\n\ud83d\udcc5 Deadline: 5 November 2026\n\